Variable Point_of_Intersecti1
Title: Point of Intersection
Description: Selects the coordinates that fall within the local boundary prescribed by the point coordinates. If neither intersection points are found within the local boundaries of the arcs, then the arcs do not actually intersect. In this case, returns Null.
Definition: If Intersection_1_Betwe=0 And Intersection_2_Betwe=0 Then~
	Null~
Else~
	Intersection_1 * Intersection_1_Betwe + Intersection_2 * Intersection_2_Betwe
NodeLocation: 672,136,1
NodeSize: 56,24
WindState: 2,168,158,648,344

