Function Spherical_to_Cartesi(Lat, Lon, radius; P:Index)
Title: Spherical to Cartesian
Description: Provides the Cartesian (x, y, z) coordinate values for a point on a sphere indicated with latitude and longitude coordinate values. The P index is a list of the names of the principal axes, x, y, z.
Definition: var x:= radius * Cos(Lon) * Sin(90-Lat);~
var y := radius * Sin(Lon) * Sin(90-Lat);~
var z := radius * Cos(90-Lat);~
~
Array(P, [x, y, z])
