Function Cartesian_to_Spheric(x, y, z; C:Index)
Title: Cartesian to Spherical
Description: Provides the latitude and longitude coordinate values for a point on a sphere indicated with Cartesian (x, y, z) coordinate values. C is a list containing the names of the spherical coordinates, usually ['Latitude', 'Longitude'].
Definition: var r := Sqrt(x^2 + y^2 + z^2);~
var lon := ArcTan(y/x);~
var lat := 90 - ArcCos(z/r);~
~
Array(C, [lat, lon])
